text: ['Sliver creatures you control have double strike. (They deal both first-strike and regular combat damage.)', 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, that creature gets +2/+0 and gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack and {T} this turn.)', '{G}: Exile target card from a graveyard. If it was a creature card, put a +1/+1 counter on Scavenging Ooze and you gain 1 life.']
flavor: ['"Their appendages are sharper than our swords and quicker than our bows."\\n—Hastric, Thunian scout', 'In nature, not a single bone or scrap of flesh goes to waste.', 'Ogres are driven by passion, rage, and another ogre standing behind them with a whip.']
